  "worked_solution": "To find every subset of $A,$ we list out every combination of elements within $A.$ \n\nWe can use the following diagram to visualize the process:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14070456/assets/6c08214e0ec5c2700561f9162c263c9677c621ff240823c261ce446dde38486a.png)\n\nNote that we must include the empty set, since it is a subset of every set.\n\nBy doing this, we get\n\n$$\n\u2205,{-1},{1},{-1,1}.\n$$",
